{"Title":"An Act to provide collective bargaining rights to employees of the mosquito control projects and mosquito control districts","BillNumber":"H1844","DocketNumber":"HD2037","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:57:58.103"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:57:58.1033333"},{"Id":null,"Name":"David Holway","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:57:58.12"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1844/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1844) of Tackey Chan and David Holway for legislation to provide collective bargaining rights to employees of the mosquito control projects and mosquito control districts.  Labor and Workforce Development.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 14D of chapter 252 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting at the end thereof the following:- Such authority shall be subject to the provisions of chapter 150E. For purposes of chapter 150E the employer shall be the state reclamation and mosquito control board.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J43","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J43"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}